#lang r7rs/neoteric
;; r7rs-lang-plan D1: `r7rs` brings its own readers -- the Scheme reader and
;; `r7rs/sweet` -- and does not span the Turmeric ones, so any other slash
;; spelling is not a base.  It is the same TUR-E0331 any unknown base gets,
;; not a silent fallback to the Scheme reader or to neoteric Turmeric.  The
;; LANG_BASES[] table is where a new pair would go.
(defn main [] : int 0)
